#. module: furniture_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,body_html:furniture_marketplace.mail_request_submitted_manufacturer
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>A customer submitted a custom furniture request addressed to <b><t t-out=\"object.manufacturer_id.name\"/></b>: <b><t t-out=\"object.title\"/></b>.</p><p>Review it in your Manufacturer Portal.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Best regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>أرسل أحد العملاء طلب أثاث مخصص موجّه إلى <b><t t-out=\"object.manufacturer_id.name\"/></b>: <b><t t-out=\"object.title\"/></b>.</p><p>يرجى مراجعته من بوابة المُصنّعين.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">مع أطيب التحيات،<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

#. module: furniture_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,body_html:furniture_marketplace.mail_request_state_changed
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p><p>The status of your request <b><t t-out=\"object.title\"/></b> (<t t-out=\"object.name\"/>) is now: <b><t t-out=\"object.state_label()\"/></b>.</p><t t-if=\"object.rejection_reason and object.state == 'rejected'\"><p><b>Reason:</b> <t t-out=\"object.rejection_reason\"/></p></t>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Best regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>عزيزي/عزيزتي <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p><p>تم تحديث حالة طلبك <b><t t-out=\"object.title\"/></b> (<t t-out=\"object.name\"/>) وأصبحت الآن: <b><t t-out=\"object.state_label()\"/></b>.</p><t t-if=\"object.rejection_reason and object.state == 'rejected'\"><p><b>السبب:</b> <t t-out=\"object.rejection_reason\"/></p></t>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">مع أطيب التحيات،<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

#. module: furniture_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,body_html:furniture_marketplace.mail_request_submitted_customer
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p><p>We received your request <b><t t-out=\"object.title\"/></b> (<t t-out=\"object.name\"/>). The selected manufacturer will review it and we will keep you updated.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Best regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>عزيزي/عزيزتي <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p><p>استلمنا طلبك <b><t t-out=\"object.title\"/></b> (<t t-out=\"object.name\"/>). ستقوم الورشة المختارة بمراجعته وسنُبقيك على اطلاع بكل جديد.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">مع أطيب التحيات،<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

#. module: furniture_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,body_html:furniture_marketplace.mail_application_approved
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.representative\"/>,</p><p>Congratulations! <b><t t-out=\"object.manufacturer_name\"/></b> has been approved as a marketplace manufacturer.</p><p>You will receive a separate e-mail with a link to set your password. Then sign in to the Manufacturer Portal at <t t-out=\"object.get_base_url()\"/>/my/manufacturer to manage your products.</p><p>Products from your catalog are submitted for product approval and become visible to customers once approved.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Best regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>عزيزي/عزيزتي <t t-out=\"object.representative\"/>,</p><p>تهانينا! <b><t t-out=\"object.manufacturer_name\"/></b> تم اعتمادها كورشة / مُصنّع في سوق الأثاث.</p><p>ستصلك رسالة بريد إلكتروني منفصلة تحتوي على رابط لتعيين كلمة المرور، ثم يمكنك تسجيل الدخول إلى بوابة المُصنّعين عبر <t t-out=\"object.get_base_url()\"/>/my/manufacturer لإدارة منتجاتك.</p><p>تم إرسال منتجات الكتالوج الخاص بك للمراجعة، وستظهر للعملاء بعد اعتمادها.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">مع أطيب التحيات،<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

#. module: furniture_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,body_html:furniture_marketplace.mail_application_rejected
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.representative\"/>,</p><p>Thank you for your interest. Unfortunately we cannot approve the application of <b><t t-out=\"object.manufacturer_name\"/></b> at this time.</p><p><b>Reason:</b> <t t-out=\"object.rejection_reason\"/></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Best regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>عزيزي/عزيزتي <t t-out=\"object.representative\"/>,</p><p>نشكرك على اهتمامك. نعتذر عن عدم إمكانية اعتماد طلب انضمام <b><t t-out=\"object.manufacturer_name\"/></b> في الوقت الحالي.</p><p><b>السبب:</b> <t t-out=\"object.rejection_reason\"/></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">مع أطيب التحيات،<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

#. module: furniture_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,body_html:furniture_marketplace.mail_application_received
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.representative\"/>,</p><p>We received the application of <b><t t-out=\"object.manufacturer_name\"/></b> (reference <b><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></b>). Our team will review it and contact you shortly.</p><p>You will receive your portal access once the application is approved.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Best regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>عزيزي/عزيزتي <t t-out=\"object.representative\"/>,</p><p>استلمنا طلب انضمام <b><t t-out=\"object.manufacturer_name\"/></b> (المرجع <b><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></b>). سيقوم فريقنا بمراجعته والتواصل معك قريبًا.</p><p>ستحصل على صلاحية الدخول إلى البوابة بعد اعتماد الطلب.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">مع أطيب التحيات،<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

#. module: furniture_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,body_html:furniture_marketplace.mail_product_approved
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>Your product <b><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></b> has been approved by the marketplace team.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Best regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>منتجك <b><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></b> تم اعتماده من قِبل فريق المنصة.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">مع أطيب التحيات،<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

#. module: furniture_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,body_html:furniture_marketplace.mail_product_rejected
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>Your product <b><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></b> was not approved.</p><p><b>Reason:</b> <t t-out=\"object.marketplace_rejection_reason\"/></p><p>You can edit the product in your portal and submit it again.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Best regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"<p>منتجك <b><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></b> لم يتم اعتماده.</p><p><b>السبب:</b> <t t-out=\"object.marketplace_rejection_reason\"/></p><p>يمكنك تعديل المنتج من البوابة وإعادة إرساله للمراجعة.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:24px;\">مع أطيب التحيات،<br/><t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

